act  even with the Indian case it was  fortunate that we had people like push  Perlman and hari priya who had direct  personal experience of GDP accounting  and natural resources and therefore it  was possible to do this project but this  is a huge developmental challenges  people have to be educated and created  in this space thank you very much  you
 

